{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The seas were calm. Your mission, simple. And then, everything changed. </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Now, a restless dread grips you and your crew. Deep down, you feel it - something <i>unwanted</i> is on board.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/extras/Des1.png?t=1746820162\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are the <strong>Second-in-Command</strong> of the <strong>33rd Fleet</strong>: now only a single Warship, but still a respected and feared one. Alongside your Captain and Third-in-Command, you lead the crew through treacherous waters.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/extras/Des2.png?t=1746820162\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nefarious beasts lurk deep beneath the surface, but they are the last thing on your mind.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/extras/Des3.png?t=1746820162\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For if there <i>is</i> a traitor amongst your men...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Things are far more dire than you perceived.<br>The sea may not be your only enemy.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Solve the mystery, or die trying.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Choose a side, don't look back.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3703340?t=1746820162","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3703340?t=1746820162","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/39f8dc6dc9fecfc0b8db12391737311704ccc3ca/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746820162","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steams